flowchart TD
    accTitle: Rendering execution families
    accDescr: Scene objects submit retained state through the server. Shared viewport and culling code selects RD or GLES3 execution. Dummy operation performs no GPU drawing.
    Scene[Scene nodes and resources] -->|submit state| Server[RenderingServerDefault]
    Server -->|coordinates| Shared[Shared viewport and culling]
    Shared -->|visible inputs| RDRenderer[RD canvas and scene renderers]
    Shared -->|visible inputs| GL[GLES3 canvas and scene renderers]
    RDRenderer -->|resource and command API| RD[RenderingDevice and command graph]
    RD -->|native commands| Driver[Vulkan D3D12 or Metal driver]
    GL -->|direct API commands| GLAPI[Current GL context]
    Driver --> GPU[GPU execution]
    GLAPI --> GPU
